rv-rs is an unofficial, unaffiliated rewrite of RomVault in Rust for Linux.
It is not made, endorsed or supported by the RomVault / RVWorld project or its
authors. "ROMVault" is the name of that project and is not used as the name of
this product.

This work is translated from, and its behaviour and file formats follow,
RomVault / RVWorld, which is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

    RVWorld
    https://github.com/RomVault/RVWorld
    tag V3.8.0, commit 0ff818d065515853f128d0c75ac5a054ab362249

This repository is a new implementation in a different language. It changes
the original: it replaces the Windows UI with GTK4, uses Linux-native paths,
and changes the behaviour of several components. Where code or structure is
carried over from the original, it remains subject to the original license
and its copyright notices. Those notices belong to their respective authors.

